      "title": {
        "en": "Veterinary team and front desk"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners praise the clinical staff, veterinary nurses, and receptionists for their attentive care, warm welcomes, and clear explanations. Many clients express gratitude for prompt treatment during routine visits. However, several reviewers report dissatisfaction with locum vets, perceived abruptness at reception, or rushed appointments."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 58,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle treatment of family pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight how kindly their dogs and cats are treated during routine wellness checks, vaccinations, and examinations. Reviewers appreciate that veterinary surgeons handle nervous pets with patience and reassurance. A minority of owners report distressing experiences during medical emergencies, but most praise the team's gentle manner."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 23,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective treatments and surgical recoveries"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents report successful clinical outcomes following minor surgeries, dental procedures, and treatment for sudden illnesses. Reviewers frequently note that prescribed medications helped their animals recover quickly and return to good health. While one reviewer experienced a tragic loss, most clients express confidence in the care provided."
      }
    }
  ],
